{"blocks":[["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-414","Creating boilerplate code from templates",["Codegen","Common Use Cases"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-459","Using AI/Coding tools and LLMs to generate code",["Codegen","Common Use Cases"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-519","Generating code from domain-specific languages (DSLs) or configuration files",["Codegen","Common Use Cases"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-600","Benefits",["Codegen"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-615","Reduces manual coding effort and potential errors",["Codegen","Benefits"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-669","Ensures consistency across generated code",["Codegen","Benefits"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-715","Allows maintaining a single source of truth (specification) that drives code generation",["Codegen","Benefits"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-807","Enables cross-language code generation from the same specification (e.g., generating SDKs in multiple languages from one OpenAPI spec)",["Codegen","Benefits"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-946","Related Concepts",["Codegen"]],["p-31faae34028d8609.html","source-block-969","Modern codegen and OpenAPI-driven SDKs are often preferred over forcing a single language across front-end and back-end boundaries (see Person/Gergely Orosz/Podcast/25/10/Python Go Rust Typescript AI Armin Ronacher)",["Codegen","Related Concepts"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-55","Compile-Time",[]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-72","Also known as: compile time, compilation time, compile-time evaluation",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-146","The phase of program development when source code is transformed into executable code by a compiler",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-249","Operations and evaluations that occur during compilation, before the program runs",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-334","Definition",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-351","The period during which a compiler processes source code",["Compile-Time","Definition"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-412","Includes syntax analysis, semantic analysis, type checking, optimization, and code generation",["Compile-Time","Definition"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-510","Errors and checks that occur during this phase are called \"compile-time errors\"",["Compile-Time","Definition"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-594","Key Characteristics",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-620","Static Analysis: The compiler analyzes code without executing it",["Compile-Time","Key Characteristics"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-693","Type Checking: Types are verified before execution",["Compile-Time","Key Characteristics"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-752","Constant Evaluation: Constant expressions are evaluated during compilation",["Compile-Time","Key Characteristics"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-835","Optimization: Code optimizations are applied before runtime",["Compile-Time","Key Characteristics"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-903","Code Generation: Source code is transformed into machine code or bytecode",["Compile-Time","Key Characteristics"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-985","Compile-Time Operations",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1015","Syntax Analysis",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1039","Parsing source code into an abstract syntax tree (AST)",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Syntax Analysis"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1099","Detecting syntax errors",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Syntax Analysis"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1128","Semantic Analysis",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1154","Type checking and type inference",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Semantic Analysis"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1192","Scope resolution",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Semantic Analysis"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1214","Name resolution",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Semantic Analysis"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1235","Constant Folding",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1260","Evaluating constant expressions at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Constant Folding"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1313","Example: const x = 2 + 3 becomes const x = 5 at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Constant Folding"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1383","Macro Expansion",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1407","Processing macros and metaprogramming constructs",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Macro Expansion"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1461","Template instantiation (in languages like C++)",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Macro Expansion"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1513","Optimization",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1534","Dead code elimination",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Optimization"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1561","Inlining",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Optimization"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1575","Constant propagation",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time Operations","Optimization"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1601","Compile-Time vs Runtime",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1631","Compile-Time: Errors caught before execution, constant values known, type safety enforced",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time vs Runtime"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1729","Runtime: Program execution, dynamic behavior, user input processing",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time vs Runtime"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1805","Many languages aim to catch as many errors as possible at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Compile-Time vs Runtime"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1880","Language Examples",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1904","Rust",["Compile-Time","Language Examples"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1917","const values must be computable at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","Rust"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-1972","Type checking happens entirely at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","Rust"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2024","Borrow checker operates at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","Rust"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2069","C/C++",["Compile-Time","Language Examples"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2083","Template metaprogramming evaluated at compile-time",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","C/C++"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2139","constexpr functions and variables",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","C/C++"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2180","TypeScript",["Compile-Time","Language Examples"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2199","Type checking occurs at compile-time (transpilation)",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","TypeScript"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2257","No runtime type information",["Compile-Time","Language Examples","TypeScript"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2290","Benefits",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2305","Early Error Detection: Catch errors before deployment",["Compile-Time","Benefits"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2367","Performance: Constant evaluation and optimization happen once, not on every execution",["Compile-Time","Benefits"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2461","Type Safety: Prevent type-related errors before runtime",["Compile-Time","Benefits"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2525","Better Tooling: IDEs can provide better autocomplete and error detection",["Compile-Time","Benefits"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2606","Related",["Compile-Time"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2620","Programming/Time/Run - The execution phase of a program",["Compile-Time","Related"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2684","Rust/Variable/Constant - Constants evaluated at compile-time in Rust",["Compile-Time","Related"]],["p-e4c23d5e9d9f3f54.html","source-block-2761","Static analysis and type systems",["Compile-Time","Related"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-21","Runtime",[]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-33","Also known as: run-time, runtime execution, execution time",["Runtime"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-95","The phase when a program is actually executing, after compilation",["Runtime"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-164","Operations and evaluations that occur while the program is running",["Runtime"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-234","Definition",["Runtime"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-251","The period during which a compiled program executes",["Runtime","Definition"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-307","The execution environment where program code runs",["Runtime","Definition"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-361","Dynamic behavior that cannot be determined until the program runs",["Runtime","Definition"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-431","Key Characteristics",["Runtime"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-457","Dynamic Execution: Code is executed with actual data and user input",["Runtime","Key Characteristics"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-533","Runtime Environment: The system that executes the program (virtual machine, interpreter, or native execution)",["Runtime","Key Characteristics"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-651","Dynamic Behavior: Values and control flow determined by runtime conditions",["Runtime","Key Characteristics"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-734","Error Handling: Runtime errors occur during execution",["Runtime","Key Characteristics"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-796","Runtime Operations",["Runtime"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-821","Program Execution",["Runtime","Runtime Operations"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-847","Instruction execution",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Program Execution"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-874","Memory allocation and deallocation",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Program Execution"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-914","Function calls and stack management",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Program Execution"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-955","Dynamic Behavior",["Runtime","Runtime Operations"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-980","User input processing",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Dynamic Behavior"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1007","Network requests",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Dynamic Behavior"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1029","File I/O operations",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Dynamic Behavior"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1054","Database queries",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Dynamic Behavior"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1076","Runtime Checks",["Runtime","Runtime Operations"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1099","Array bounds checking (in some languages)",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Runtime Checks"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1146","Null pointer checks",["Runtime","Runtime Operations","Runtime Checks"]],["p-df879350c3f21578.html","source-block-1171","Type checks 